              The closest named-summit trail is <strong>{closestHikes[0]?.name}</strong>, {Math.round(closestHikes[0]?.distance)} miles away
              ({closestHikes[0]?.driveTime} minute drive from {closestHikes[0]?.nearerCity}), on New Jersey's Kittatinny Ridge.
            </div>
