                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="p-4 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
              {slide ? (
                <>Slide Mountain is roughly {Math.round(slide.distance)} miles from {slide.nearerCity}, about a
                {' '}{slide.driveTime}-minute drive north through the Catskills — the tallest peak in the
                range and this guide's farthest-tier anchor to the north.</>
              ) : (
                <>Slide Mountain is roughly 77 miles from Scranton, about a 103-minute drive north through
